# The fold of cycles of cyc_lpc in the coordinates u = x + 0.7 y, v = y, a constant
# linear map that is not orthogonal. A change of coordinates leaves the normal form
# coefficient unchanged, so b = -4 here too, while the adjoint eigenfunction differs
# from the one of cyc_lpc. Own test model.
par mu=0
x=u-0.7*v
y=v
s=x^2+y^2
P=mu+2*s-s^2
Om=1+s
fx=x*P-y*Om
fy=y*P+x*Om
u'=fx+0.7*fy
v'=fy
init u=1,v=0
done
